OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost third of GCSE pupils
OL,4,Aawarded top A* and A grades
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost a third of GCSE entries in
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland have again been
OL,8,Fawarded the top A* and A grades.
OL,10,FThat is much higher than in England or
OL,11,FWales.
OL,13,FOverall results in Northern Ireland in
OL,14,F2026 were relatively similar to those
OL,15,Fin 2025, which had been predicted.
OL,17,FOver 32,000 students received their
OL,18,FGCSE results on Thursday.
